attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le08ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get out of hand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not be able to be controlled any more"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I feel like my insomnia is getting out of hand!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about hypnosis."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to notice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to realize something that you can feel "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Have you noticed a change in your sleep schedule?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hypnotherapy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the use of hypnosis to treat physical problems"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to try out hypnotherapy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to tap into"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be able to understand something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A hypnotherapist can tap into your mind."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "subconscious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the part of your mind that has thoughts and feelings you do not know about"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They can even tap into your subconscious. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to uncover"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to find out about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The therapist will uncover the reason behind your issue."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "root"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the main cause of a problem"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What do you think is the root cause of your insomnia? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inability"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the fact of being unable to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to know the cause of my inability to sleep."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "treatment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that is done to cure someone who is ill"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The treatment will start right away. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob06aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present and Present Continuous "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use Simple Present to describe actions or situations that exist now and will go on indefinitely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\"><span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>: Do you have medical insurance?<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes I do. I always have it with me.</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Continuous to talk about particular actions or situations that started but have not finished at the time of speaking."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'm taking some medication. </span></li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Offering Advice and Solutions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you visit a doctor, you share an issue with your health or ask for advice. You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is like slowly or suddenly.</p>  The doctor will offer advice and solutions to on how to improve your health. They can use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could, should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to give a solution.</p> They can use the modal <span class=\"italic\">must</span> or expressions like You <span class=\"italic\">have got to ...</span> or going to have to to express what is necessary. They may also use adverbs of manner to describe how something should be done like <span class=\"italic\">gradually</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You've got to gradually increase the time you exercise."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm going to have to ask you to write down everything you eat."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You need to keep a sleep diary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the following to express what is necessary: <ul><li>You had better ...</li> <li>You have got to...</li> <li>I'm going to have to...</li> <li>You need to...</li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. Do some research about hypnotherapy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do you have any questions about how it works? Find the answers to your questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "What are other problems that could be solved by hypnotherapy? Make a list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Using all the information you have found, write a short report about hypnotherapy. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your report and share it with your class. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research hypnotherapy on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I offer solutions in my report."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can offer advice and solutions about healthy habits."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about what people do or what people are doing."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about what is necessary. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What do you think about hypnosis?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Would you ever try it? Why or why not?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Let's visit the doctor's office with Vanessa!"}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text"