1000", "image": "engenn6le08ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Coats</span>: Hmm ... it's an option. You could also take some medication to help you sleep.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'd prefer not to.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Coats</span>: Okay. I'm going to have to set you up with a hypnotherapist.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How will it work? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Coats</span>: A hypnotherapist can tap into your subconscious to uncover the root cause of your inability to sleep. Then, the treatment can begin. You need to accept that it may not work though."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}